msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Hey, I know this was kinda weird, Akiho-san, but I had fun tonight. I'll be "
"back for sure. Oh, and say hi to Natsumi for me, will ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Of course. I'm sure she'll be surprised to hear I ran into you of all "
"people. What are you up to nowadays, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Well... I'm part of the Ryudo Family. The yakuza gig runnin' downtown, "
"remember? I'm actually their captain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Yakuza? I would never have pegged you for that kind of lifestyle, Rikiya-"
"kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Well, there's a lot more to me than whatever Natsumi told you, I'm sure. Oh,"
" and just call me Rikiya. By the way, here's my cell. Gimme a line if you "
"ever need help with something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "You know, I might just do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Well, let's get goin', Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

